WEBVTT


00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:05.955
Buying your first home in Ireland? Stop. Watch this before

00:00:05.955 --> 00:00:07.100
you sign anything.

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:11.641
One. You can borrow up to four times your income,

00:00:11.641 --> 00:00:15.700
with a ten percent deposit. But choose a repayment you can sleep on.

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:21.800
Two. Add stamp duty, legal fees and a survey to your budget.

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:27.400
Three. Claim every benefit: Help to Buy, and the First Home Scheme.

00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:32.200
Four. Fixed gives certainty, variable can move.

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:37.800
Five. Get approval in principle before you view a single house.

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:42.000
Six. Protect your family with mortgage protection.

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:46.253
Do this, and eight months later, you're holding the keys.

00:00:46.253 --> 00:00:48.000
Time to put the kettle on.
